SUMMARY:Little Moo & Makers Market
DESCRIPTION:The Little Moo & Makers Market is coming to Gather and Feast Farm — a Sunday market series filled with local shopping\, Highland cows\, piglets\, springtime magic\, wood-fired food\, and all the farm charm you could possibly want. Think fresh air\, baby animals\, handmade goods\, farm-made treasures\, and a whole lot of community.Mark your calendars:Sunday\, April 26Sunday\, May 3Sunday\, May 10Free admission. Free parking. They’re bringing together farmers\, ranchers\, makers\, local crafters\, and cottage food producers for a beautiful outdoor market experience on the farm. Farm-made and hand-made gets first dibs.This one is going to be extra special — baby animal season\, local vendors\, spring on the farm\, and if all goes to plan… our brand new little moo may be here too.Gather and Feast Farm2706 NE 369th stLacenter\, Wa. 98629
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/little-moo-makers-market/2026-04-26/
LOCATION:Gather and Feast Farm\, 2706 NE 369th st\, Lacenter\, Washington
CATEGORIES:Animals,Family Fun,Farm,Kids Calendar,Mother's Day,Outdoor,Plants & Nature
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/little-moo-and-makers-market.jpg
END:VEVENT
