SUMMARY:82nd Avenue of Roses Parade
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of the 82nd Avenue of Roses Parade’s 20th year (theme: History of East Portland)\, enjoy an expanded 3-day event with multiple activities happening each day including the famous Roses in the Heart of Portland Parade\, Funtastic Carnival\, classic car show\, farmers market\, and Rose Photo Contest. Visit the event host’s website for schedule details! \n82nd Avenue of Roses Parade route is on SE 82nd Avenue\, between SE Holgate & Division on April 25th\, stepping off at 9:30AM.
