SUMMARY:Bonsai Week
DESCRIPTION:Join Portland Japanese Garden for Bonsai Week from April 21 – 28 as we celebrate the return of our beloved bonsai collection! Come discover the beauty of these tiny trees through special activities in the Family Studio\, bonsai-themed items in the Gift Shop\, Bonsai Society of Portland Show and demonstrations\, and more! We’ll also have a delightful opportunity to learn more about bonsai in our new Garden Experience Center (formerly the Membership Center) nestled within our historic Garden spaces. \nIncluded with daily admission to Portland Japanese Garden \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission. 
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/bonsai-week/2026-04-27/
